<title>ITALY: TABLE - ITALY JUNE WHOLESALE PRICES FELL 0.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ITALY JUNE WHOLESALE PRICES FELL 0.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for June.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	  June 97     May 97	June 96</p>
<p> Year/Year change	 -0.3 pct     -0.2 pct    +2.4 pct</p>
<p> Month/Month change     -0.4 pct     +0.2 pct    -0.4 pct</p>
<p> Index (base 1990 =100)  133.5	  134.1	 133.9</p>
<p>It gave the following breakdown for wholesale prices:</p>
<p>				  Month/Month change  Year/Year change</p>
<p>    Consumer goods	   -0.6 pct		 -1.0 pct</p>
<p>    Investment goods	  0.0 pct		 +3.5 pct</p>
<p>    Intermediate goods     -0.4 pct		 -0.3 pct</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
